{"text": "# EXHIBIT \"C\" to the Affidavit of Summer Doucette\n\nLandlord and Tenant Board file **LTB-T-048812-25** (Form T2 and Form T6 applications, heard together)\nRental unit: Unit 2, 318 Barton Lane, Hamilton ON L8H 2V6\nPrepared by Delphine Achieng, licensed paralegal (LSO # P14772), Loomis Achieng Legal Services, 905-555-0164, dachieng@loomisachieng.example\n\n## Legend\n\nScreenshots exported from the Tenant's phone (289-555-0117) on January 9, 2026. The contact saved as \"Gary landlord\" is the Landlord, Gurpreet Mangat of Mangat Family Rentals Ltd., texting from (905) 555-0139. \"Rocky\" is his son Rakesh Mangat, who does the repairs and texts from 9055550181. \"Ty\" is the Tenant's partner, Tyrell Bundy. Spelling is as sent. Transcribed by D.A.\n\n## Messages\n\n**Nov 3, 8:14 pm — Summer:** Hi Gary its Summer in unit 2. furnace is out AGAIN, 3rd time since Oct 20. its 14 degrees in here\n\n**8:31 pm — Gary:** ok will send Rocky tmrw morning. he has the key\n\n**Nov 4, 7:02 am — Summer:** pls have him knock first. Ty works nights and my mom Olive is staying w me after her hip replacement\n\n**7:40 am — Rocky:** this is Rocky, new number. side door code still 4471# ? im in Brampton till noon\n\n**7:41 am — Summer:** yes. and the mould in the bathroom is making my asthma worse, I told your dad in Sept\n\n**Nov 6, 5:55 pm — Gary:** Rocky says furnace needs a part, $640. U still owe 275 for Oct hydro. and rent was short\n\n**5:58 pm — Summer:** rent was not short!! I sent $1,450 by Interac e-Transfer on the 1st to gmangat.rentals@mailbox.example, password was barton318 like always. The other $497 comes straight from ODSP, you know I'm on disability\n\n**6:10 pm — Gary:** it went to the old account. new one is Wexford Savings transit 01882 acct 5507731. my wife Joy does the books now, send to joy.mangat@mailbox.example\n\n**Nov 19, 9:20 pm — Gary:** i hear your boyfriend is on probation. i dont want police at my building. maybe time u find another place\n\n**9:26 pm — Summer:** thats not your business and its not grounds under the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006. Im keeping these texts\n\n**Dec 1, 8:03 am — Gary:** N4 is on your door. $1,725 by Dec 15 or I file\n\n**8:30 am — Summer:** I owe you nothing. s. 20(1) says YOU fix the heat. My paralegal Ms. Achieng will be in touch\n\n**12/19, 4:12 pm — Rocky:** dad says drop the hydro cheque at the house, 77 Gladstone Ave in Stoney Creek, mailbox by the garage\n\n**Boxing Day, 11:47 am — Summer:** heat is off again. 2nd is the earliest Rocky can come?? my mom is 77 with a new hip. Mrs. Mangat isnt answering either\n\n**11:52 am — Gary:** call Rakesh not me. LOL happy holidays\n\n## Paralegal's note\n\nRent ledger from Wexford Savings Credit Union is Exhibit \"D\". Mr. Mangat has not disputed that the Nov 6 and Dec 1 messages are his. Ms. Doucette and Mr. Bundy will both attend; Olive Doucette by phone at 519-555-0172.", "kind": "Markdown document", "detail": "506 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Summer Doucette", "Gary landlord", "Gurpreet Mangat", "Rakesh Mangat", "Tyrell Bundy", "Olive", "Gary", "Rocky", "Summer", "Achieng", "Rakesh", "Mr. Mangat", "Olive Doucette", "Doucette", "Bundy"], "companies": ["Mangat Family Rentals Ltd.", "Loomis Achieng Legal Services", "Wexford Savings", "Wexford Savings Credit Union"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Hamilton", "Barton Lane", "Brampton", "Wexford Savings", "Stoney Creek", "Gladstone Ave"], "health": ["asthma", "hip replacement", "disability", "mould"], "sensitive": ["probation", "Residential Tenancies Act", "Wexford Savings Credit Union"], "names": ["Summer", "Gary", "Rocky", "Ty", "Olive", "Rakesh", "Joy", "Doucette", "Bundy", "Achieng", "Mangat"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 0.10000000149011612, "topicMs": 39669.39999999851, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", 